      "message": "constexpr uint64_t mask \u003d 0x00ff00ff00ff00ff;\nuint64_t argb \u003d mask \u0026 ((dst \u003c\u003c 24) | dst);\nargb *\u003d scale;\nargb \u0026\u003d mask;\nargb +\u003d mask \u0026 ((src \u003c\u003c 24) | src);\n\nthen do saturate on uint32 instead.\n\nreturn argb \u003e\u003e 32 | argb;\n\nI don\u0027t have time to check this out on Compiler Optimizer, but I can return to it after my haircut and lunch.",
