      "writtenOn": "2023-01-20T17:07:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I had spent a while trying to do this that way when I first looked at it. I ended up having to do so much extra math to isolate and combine things that I never got anything quicker. I am playing around with the 64-bit version now.",
